{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-9","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例","englishTitle":"Magnitudes which have the same ratio to the same are equal to one another; and magnitudes to which the same has the same ratio are equal.","book":5,"number":9,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.9","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.9/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":9,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-9@raw-4a88142fd5ce11c4","contentId":"euclid-5-9","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a88142fd5ce11c4a1cdb590077e02094f5f1efe4643046237ab0a0106e846a5","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-9.statement","euclid-5-9.construction.1","euclid-5-9.proof.1","euclid-5-9.proof.2","euclid-5-9.proof.3","euclid-5-9.conclusion","euclid-5-9.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-9.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-9","revisionId":"euclid-5-9@raw-4a88142fd5ce11c4","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1a50fe8c1beebf4774824da4f202710254afaa1b3eaff1b0ac6bc6bc85d3bf0a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Magnitudes which have the same ratio to the same are equal to one another; and magnitudes to which the same has the same ratio are equal."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同一比例的磁度是等同的;同一比例的大小是等同的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-9.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-9","revisionId":"euclid-5-9@raw-4a88142fd5ce11c4","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d437a9d36cef89190a10f7a18744f530f0f2f1fc3f371228070fa2bffd08b0dc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let each of the magnitudes A, B have the same ratio to C; I say that A is equal to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B等等值的比重与C等值相同;我说A等值为B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-9.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-9","revisionId":"euclid-5-9@raw-4a88142fd5ce11c4","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1a4df5f5ed80e1450aa5f9b9513008bd53f7619824ea38df268b49353db397a7","citations":["euclid-5-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, otherwise, each of the magnitudes A, B would not have had the same ratio to C; [[V. 8](/principles/euclid-5-8)] but it has; therefore A is equal to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"否则,A、B等等等中的每一等都与C等之比不同;但相形之下,A等等于B等。 [[V. 8](/principles/euclid-5-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-9.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-9","revisionId":"euclid-5-9@raw-4a88142fd5ce11c4","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"28f13ffd45b96266144aabc7dcb09721283c7125553c6831cf4779d91a1bdaed","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let C have the same ratio to each of the magnitudes A, B; I say that A is equal to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,C星等与A、B星等的比相同;我说,A星等等于B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-9.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-9","revisionId":"euclid-5-9@raw-4a88142fd5ce11c4","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a8b1dd362cf4bb7919a6cbb2ece0d2349a4b7067ff1f586043365760930e044a","citations":["euclid-5-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, otherwise, C would not have had the same ratio to each of the magnitudes A, B; [[V. 8](/principles/euclid-5-8)] but it has; therefore A is equal to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"否则,C星等与A、B星等的比将不相同,但已经相同;因此,A星等等于B。 [[V. 8](/principles/euclid-5-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-9.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-9","revisionId":"euclid-5-9@raw-4a88142fd5ce11c4","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-9.source","contentId":"euclid-5-9","revisionId":"euclid-5-9@raw-4a88142fd5ce11c4","order":6,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"29f2e8380f9255e2f5e75fcc6a32ed00643d8380344ef771f5fd6852320a0691","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.9/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.9\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-9:euclid-5-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-9.proof.1","euclid-5-9.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:t